{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5f60cac3b8aa3f3bc5953795c94e4207.avif?t=1771512799\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive deep into Action-RPG with roguelike elements and a tale about new beginnings. With no coin to your name, you and the other townsfolk find yourselves stranded in the distant village of Tresna. Now, it\u2019s up to you to get back on your feet and turn your humble shop into the beating heart of the village\u2019s wealth. Explore dangerous dungeons, gather relics, sell them, and reinvest in your friends\u2019 establishments. Unlock new weapons, armor, shop decorations, and\u2014more importantly\u2014restore hope that things can one day turn around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1771512799\" width=1 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1771512799\" width=1 height=10 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/74eec0d3818ca389939edc03952e01cc.poster.avif?t=1771512799\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/74eec0d3818ca389939edc03952e01cc.webm?t=1771512799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/eef82a5aa42d70bfee4d905a5cc61a66.avif?t=1771512799\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Profitable perils await, so strap on your trusty backpack and dive right in. Trust your adventurer instincts to plot a clever route, then carefully arrange your loot to maximize profits. Remember: the further you delve, the greater the rewards. How far will you dare to go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1771512799\" width=1 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/db154f86ef36e596ae6455da95535d39.poster.avif?t=1771512799\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/db154f86ef36e596ae6455da95535d39.webm?t=1771512799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/79428c57b7f2797a9d7e8ad8c00239ab.avif?t=1771512799\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After each escapade, you put your hard-earned loot on sale. That\u2019s where your shop-owner charm will shine. Deck out the shop, read your customers, and set your own price to score the perfect deal. Cash in on special events while unlocking perks to build sales momentum. Battered scrap or shiny relic, their value isn\u2019t fixed; it\u2019s decided by you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1771512799\" width=1 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/e2fd7b202f731661d4472bdbff8b8ab1.poster.avif?t=1771512799\" width=601 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/e2fd7b202f731661d4472bdbff8b8ab1.webm?t=1771512799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/dca5f95a64f81ec7b478a187f2015ec3.avif?t=1771512799\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A merchant can only be as prosperous as their village. Invest in the townsfolks\u2019 establishments to obtain better weapons, armor, and upgrades. As the village thrives and grows more vibrant, new people (and money!) will be drawn towards your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1771512799\" width=1 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/1354eac159321f817a18cdec980d0338.poster.avif?t=1771512799\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/1354eac159321f817a18cdec980d0338.webm?t=1771512799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5be8e5a5b9d63df2fbff17b8fa551b18.avif?t=1771512799\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face the challenge of the Endless Vault, an ancient artifact that tests merchants' skills to their limits.  Conquer the Vault's trials to upgrade your town, and continuously raise the stakes for even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/0c6a5c0610ddead2c9fbc8d16104b74b.poster.avif?t=1771512799\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/0c6a5c0610ddead2c9fbc8d16104b74b.webm?t=1771512799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Back to Business","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2350790/e99f2f4cba83ff2ba403ea7cdb926b1fb4faf9cc.jpg"},{"name":"Back on Track","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2350790/7ca4c93b2030c7667613a7506f047d5a7d75b07c.jpg"},{"name":"Wishing Well","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2350790/a82fe6356cedc7b87848888d316a0b27a72046d2.jpg"},{"name":"Just Like Old Times","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2350790/8210844b2e76dc280f0fe32ffe1216a870d33693.jpg"},{"name":"Out of Tune","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2350790/ae37fe5370c9a9963a04f50e8b08197ba461e175.jpg"},{"name":"The Fallen King","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2350790/ad7289db5ed86c3f641a36c8c1fe6ce5a086dbfc.jpg"},{"name":"An Unwelcome Guest","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2350790/03216cdf629af9730c434425c52c8574593fa05b.jpg"},{"name":"Forced Shutdown","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2350790/a3bf85224cd03d3da87032203481953db0348f0e.jpg"},{"name":"Dismissal Letter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2350790/58106d4309d9c39dcd57f67cce015791d8a56ac3.jpg"},{"name":"Overture","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/2350790/23a70e2d78bcc1e7fb5d687a1c97687d51a221a9.jpg"}],"total":38},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2350790?t=1771512799","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/4b61547ad415e35c77a037926dce8a012cae7f14/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771512799","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/3524524545ff53b6b749e240bd4743345d797a4e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771512799","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/3524524545ff53b6b749e240bd4743345d797a4e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771512799","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>ROADMAP</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/ebbb83f4c3a2fa2e721153a7a3c51c84.avif?t=1771512799\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p></p><br><h1>Feature List</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/2b0e8f1ceefe9ca5f0100d63077b7b5d.avif?t=1771512799\" width=780 height=756 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5f60cac3b8aa3f3bc5953795c94e4207.avif?t=1771512799\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dive deep into Action-RPG with roguelike elements and a tale about new beginnings. With no coin to your name, you and the other townsfolk find yourselves stranded in the distant village of Tresna. Now, it\u2019s up to you to get back on your feet and turn your humble shop into the beating heart of the village\u2019s wealth. Explore dangerous dungeons, gather relics, sell them, and reinvest in your friends\u2019 establishments. Unlock new weapons, armor, shop decorations, and\u2014more importantly\u2014restore hope that things can one day turn around.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1771512799\" width=1 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1771512799\" width=1 height=10 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/74eec0d3818ca389939edc03952e01cc.poster.avif?t=1771512799\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/74eec0d3818ca389939edc03952e01cc.webm?t=1771512799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/eef82a5aa42d70bfee4d905a5cc61a66.avif?t=1771512799\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Profitable perils await, so strap on your trusty backpack and dive right in. Trust your adventurer instincts to plot a clever route, then carefully arrange your loot to maximize profits. Remember: the further you delve, the greater the rewards. How far will you dare to go?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1771512799\" width=1 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/db154f86ef36e596ae6455da95535d39.poster.avif?t=1771512799\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/db154f86ef36e596ae6455da95535d39.webm?t=1771512799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/79428c57b7f2797a9d7e8ad8c00239ab.avif?t=1771512799\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After each escapade, you put your hard-earned loot on sale. That\u2019s where your shop-owner charm will shine. Deck out the shop, read your customers, and set your own price to score the perfect deal. Cash in on special events while unlocking perks to build sales momentum. Battered scrap or shiny relic, their value isn\u2019t fixed; it\u2019s decided by you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1771512799\" width=1 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/e2fd7b202f731661d4472bdbff8b8ab1.poster.avif?t=1771512799\" width=601 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/e2fd7b202f731661d4472bdbff8b8ab1.webm?t=1771512799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/dca5f95a64f81ec7b478a187f2015ec3.avif?t=1771512799\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">A merchant can only be as prosperous as their village. Invest in the townsfolks\u2019 establishments to obtain better weapons, armor, and upgrades. As the village thrives and grows more vibrant, new people (and money!) will be drawn towards your shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/33c1e98635a403f0460e06f14bf58c11.webp?t=1771512799\" width=1 height=10 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/1354eac159321f817a18cdec980d0338.poster.avif?t=1771512799\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/1354eac159321f817a18cdec980d0338.webm?t=1771512799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/5be8e5a5b9d63df2fbff17b8fa551b18.avif?t=1771512799\" width=616 height=74 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Face the challenge of the Endless Vault, an ancient artifact that tests merchants' skills to their limits.  Conquer the Vault's trials to upgrade your town, and continuously raise the stakes for even greater rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/0c6a5c0610ddead2c9fbc8d16104b74b.poster.avif?t=1771512799\" width=600 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2350790/extras/0c6a5c0610ddead2c9fbc8d16104b74b.webm?t=1771512799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Digital Sun"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"